# Dschubba

id:world-dschubba a oa:Place, oa:World ;
    skos:prefLabel "Dschubba" ;
    oa:article <https://www.orionsarm.com/eg-article/486ea9fa62cdb> ;
    oa:editorialNote "---- Deeper Covenant ----------------------------------------------------\n\nA close-in roster, and the best-measured one here: four of its six places\nare inside 20 ly, and every stated distance that could be checked agreed\nwith the catalogue to a tenth of a percent. Two of them are brown dwarfs no\ncatalogue this map loads carries at all, and both are still located — the\narticles give distances to stars that are here, which is a position written\ndown the long way." ;
    oa:kind "system" ;
    oa:labelsSystem false ;
    oa:note "Delta Scorpii, held by the Triumvirate — a joint body of the Negentropy Alliance, the Mutual Progress Association and the Fomalhaut Acquisition Society, described at https://www.orionsarm.com/eg-article/47a67e21db6fd. All three are drawn rather than one colour for the Triumvirate itself, so the ring shows what it is made of. The add-on places the star at 402 ly and the catalogue at 491, an 18% disagreement that the add-on's position is used across." ;
    oa:uncertain false .

